1);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>视角 1：工程范式（怎么搭）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>看 Agent 的</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>控制结构</span></strong><span>演化——从「一个提示技巧」到「一套工程体系」：</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>CoT（2022 提示）→ ReAct（2022 循环）→ Plan-and-Execute（2023 分离）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>→ Reflexion（2023 反思）→ Multi-Agent（2023 分工）→ Workflow 编排（2024-25 平台化）</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>核心张力：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>确定性 vs 灵活性</span></strong><span>——流水线越确定越稳，循环越自由越灵活；生产选型就是在这条轴上找平衡点。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>视角 2：研究范式（为什么对）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>看 Agent 背后的</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>学术路线之争</span></strong><span>——两种血统的碰撞与融合：</span></p><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>血统</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>基础</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>优点</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>缺点</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>Agent 中的角色</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>符号派</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>MDP/POMDP、BDI、SOAR、规划器</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>确定性、可验证、可解释</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>僵化、需人工规则</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>约束层、校验层、规划器</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>神经派</span></strong></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>深度强化学习、LLM</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>泛化、自适应、理解自然语言</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>幻觉、不可审计、易注入</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>感知层、决策层、生成层</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2025-2026 的共识不是「谁取代谁」，而是</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>混合（神经符号）</span></strong><span>：神经管流畅、符号管严谨（ATA 框架等）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:26px 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.5;border-left:4px solid #059669;padding-left:12px;\"><span>视角 3：应用范式（拿来干嘛）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>看 Agent 在</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>产品里的定位</span></strong><span>演化：</span></p><section style=\"margin:8px 0 22px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#0F172A;box-shadow:0 10px 24px rgba(15,23,42,0.18);\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 14px;background:#020617;\"><span style=\"margin-left:8px;font-size:12px;color:#64748B;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;\"><span>code</span></span></section><section style=\"padding:12px 14px 14px;\"><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>对话助手 → Copilot（人主 Agent 辅）→ 自主 Agent（Agent 主 人监督）→ Autopilot（全自动+熔断）</span></p><p style=\"margin:0;font-family:Consolas,Monaco,monospace;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#E2E8F0;\"><span>工作流（确定流水线）→ Agent（动态决策）→ 两者混合（2026 主流）</span></p></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>2026 被定义为&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>Agent 商用元年</span></strong><span>：MCP/A2A 标准化、行业落地（研发评审/质检/办公/编码全流程）规模化。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>04</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>二、发展路线时间线</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px 0 24px;overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:520px;background:#fff;\"><thead><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>时间</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>范式事件</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;background:#ECFDF5;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;white-space:nowrap;\"><section><span>视角</span></section></td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2022</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>CoT（提示思考）/ ReAct（推理行动交错）</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>工程</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2023</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Toolformer / Reflexion / Plan-and-Execute / AutoGPT / MetaGPT / Generative Agents</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>工程 + 研究</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2024</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>Function Calling 标准化 / o1（推理模型）/ MCP 开源 / Computer Use</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>工程 + 应用</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2025</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>双血统综述、自进化综述（SWE-RL）/ 神经符号成熟 / LangGraph 1.0 / GPT-5</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>研究 + 工程</span></section></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>2026</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>MCP 无状态化（AAIF）/ 商用元年 / 混合架构成主流</span></section></td><td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #E5E7EB;font-size:13px;color:#374151;line-height:1.6;\"><section><span>应用 + 研究</span></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>05</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>三、三个关键范式命题（贯穿全系列）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>推理和行动要不要分开？</span></strong><span>&nbsp;ReAct 说「交错」，Plan-and-Execute 说「先全盘规划再执行」——两者对成本、可预测性、出错恢复的取舍完全不同（01-02 篇）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>符号和神经要不要结合？</span></strong><span>&nbsp;纯 LLM 流畅但不可靠，纯符号严谨但僵化——神经符号怎么分工（04-06 篇）；</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>人应该在哪？</span></strong><span>&nbsp;Copilot（人在主导）→ Autopilot（机器主导）——自主度怎么渐进（07-08 篇）。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>06</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>四、本篇要点（复习卡片）</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>1</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>三视角</span></strong><span>：工程（怎么搭）/ 研究（为什么对）/ 应用（拿来干嘛）——同一范式三张脸。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>2</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>工程谱系</span></strong><span>：CoT→ReAct→P&amp;E→Reflexion→Multi-Agent→Workflow；主轴 = 确定性 vs 灵活性。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>3</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>研究双血统</span></strong><span>：符号（可验证）vs 神经（泛化）→ 混合（神经符号）是 2025-2026 共识。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>4</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>应用谱系</span></strong><span>：对话→Copilot→自主 Agent→Autopilot；工作流→Agent→混合。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>5</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>三命题</span></strong><span>：分不分开（推理/行动）、结不结合（符号/神经）、人在哪（Copilot/Autopilot）。</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;min-width:22px;height:22px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-right:10px;border-radius:999px;background:#ECFDF5;color:#059669;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;\"><span>6</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>2026 定位</span></strong><span>：Agent 商用元年——标准化 + 行业落地。</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>07</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>五、下一篇预告</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><span>第 01 篇（板块一·工程）：</span><strong style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:700;\"><span>推理-行动交错范式</span></strong><span>——从 CoT 的「只动脑」到 ReAct 的「边想边做」：ReAct 为什么成为 Agent 范式原点，它和 CoT/Self-Ask/ToT 的谱系关系，以及 ReAct 的局限（为什么后来要 Plan-and-Execute）。</span></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 18px;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#059669;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-1px;\"><span>08</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;\"><span>SECTION</span></span></section><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:19px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;line-height:1.4;\"><span>参考资料</span></p><section style=\"width:40px;height:3px;margin-top:12px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#059669,#10B981);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] ReAct（2022）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] Agentic AI: A Comprehensive Survey（双血统，2510.25445）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2510.25445</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] A Survey of Self-Evolving Agents（2507.21046）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.21046</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] A Survey on Agent Workflow（2508.01186）：</span><span>https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.01186</span></span></p><p style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;\"><span style=\"color:#059669;font-weight:900;margin-right:10px;line-height:1.6;\"><span>•</span></span><span style=\"flex:1;\"><span>[官方] General Framework of AI Agents（李航, JCST 2026）：</span><span>https://jcst.ict.ac.cn/</span></span></p><section style=\"margin:30px 0;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:72px;height:2px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#059669,transparent);\"><span><br /></span></section></section><p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.9;color:#374151;letter-spacing:0.4px;\"><em style=\"font-style:italic;\"><span>整理：2026-10-01 月绡凝 · 依据官方论文与综述。</span></em></p><section style=\"margin:40px 0 0;\"><section style=\"height:1px;background:#E5E7EB;margin-bottom:28px;\"><span><br /></span></section></section></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type></mp-style-type></p>",
